  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement MAU in RS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Revisionsmyndighet RS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att uppr&#xE4;tta en revisionsmyndighet (PMAU) som gentemot Republika Srpskas givarl&#xE4;nder blir en garanti f&#xF6;r att bist&#xE5;ndet i enlighet med godtagbara och/eller avtalade normer. Projektet administreras av V&#xE4;rldsbanken.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to establish a Procurement, Monitoring and Audit Unit in Republika Srpska, which will be a guarantee to the involved countries that the contributions are in accordance to the agreements. The project is administrated by the World Bank.</narrative>
  </description>
